  "texts": {
    "briefing": "You've been discovered! The enemy is planning\nan attack!\n\nIntelligence has informed us that there are two\ncrucial convoys passing here today - a train to\nthe south and a van to the northeast. Both\ncontain material that could be vital in the\nenemy's attempt to construct a base to the west.\nDestroy them both immediately, before the train\ncan reach the safety of the mountain pass and the\nvan arrive at the enemy base. Good luck.\n\nOne final note - be careful with your ammunition\nas we are currently awaiting an overdue supply\nconvoy. Weapons are a little on the scarce side\nbut should suffice nonetheless.",
    "success": "Congratulations on stopping the enemy, but\nbe prepared, the enemy will be attacking\nsoon!",
    "failure": "Be quick to complete this mission!"
  },
